cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HJTK Ensemble: a Kotlin multi-agent orchestration SDK"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Heo Taehyeok"
    alias: "heok0308hth-glitch"
repository-code: "https://github.com/heok0308hth-glitch/HJTK"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-24
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - LLM orchestration
  - Kotlin
  - Android
  - AI agents
abstract: >-
  Ensemble is a lightweight Kotlin library that makes several large language models
  (Claude, GPT, Gemini, Grok, DeepSeek, local models) work as one team. A center/PM
  plans and reviews. A load-aware dispatcher assigns tasks by real strengths and
  live track record. Teammates share findings on a board, and results are
  cross-checked by a different vendor's model. A company mode runs 30-minute to
  3-hour projects with charters, sprints, review scores, stand-ups and final QA.
